  "description": "*\"I'm gonna live a normal life!\"*\n\nCho-Eun, the heir to the powerful underground clan, Hongsal, has entered university. Her only wish? To make lots of friends and enjoy a peaceful, ordinary college life. But who are these four mysterious guys constantly hanging around her?\n\n *\"Are you my enemy? My ally? Or... do you like me?\"*\n\nThrown into a whirlwind of emotions at twenty, can Cho-Eun finally achieve the campus life she's always dreamed of?\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
